<% content_for :title, 'Guided VAT determination prototype' %>

<div class="govuk-grid-row">
  <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
    <span class="govuk-caption-xl">Prototype</span>
    <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">Guided VAT determination</h1>

    <%= govuk_warning_text(text: 'This prototype uses illustrative rules and must not be used to make a VAT declaration.') %>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      The production-shaped model starts with the VAT options returned by tariff data. It maps the commodity to a reusable, effective-dated rule set and stops when approved guidance is unavailable or not specific enough.
    </p>

    <%= govuk_inset_text do %>
      In the duty calculator, every commodity with more than one live VAT option can enter the journey. Reviewed products use specific HMRC questions; every other product uses a generic confirmation journey built from its live tariff options.
    <% end %>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      The example below demonstrates a reviewed question set. To test the generic journey, start a duty calculation for any other commodity that has more than one VAT option.
    </p>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">Choose an example</h2>

    <% @journeys.each do |journey| %>
      <section class="govuk-!-margin-bottom-7">
        <h3 class="govuk-heading-m"><%= journey.title %></h3>
        <p class="govuk-body"><%= journey.description %></p>
        <% if journey.commodity_code.present? %>
          <p class="govuk-body-s">Tariff commodity code: <strong><%= journey.commodity_code %></strong></p>
        <% end %>
        <p class="govuk-body-s">
          Shared rule set: <strong><%= journey.rule_set_id.humanize %></strong><br>
          Review status: <strong><%= journey.review_status.to_s.humanize %></strong><br>
          Rule effective from: <strong><%= journey.guidance_version_from.to_fs(:long) %></strong><br>
          Mapping effective from: <strong><%= journey.applicability_from.to_fs(:long) %></strong><br>
          Simulated tariff options:
          <%= journey.applicable_vat_options.map { |key, label| "#{label} (#{key})" }.to_sentence %>
        </p>
        <%= button_to 'Try this example', vat_guidance_prototype_start_path,
                      params: { journey_id: journey.id }, method: :post,
                      class: 'govuk-button govuk-button--secondary' %>
      </section>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
